      "value": "No, this is not something that would get you banned.\n\nIt is not uncommon for people to get banned for one thing and try to tell their friends they got banned for something else that sounds ridiculous and unfair.\n\nThe only grain of truth to this is that you cannot be logged into the same account in two places and logged into the same instance at the same time. That won't get you banned though, just kicked. Those two devices can exist on the same account in separate instances just fine.",
