  "details": "(This is not a feature request I just don’t know where I would ask this)\n\nSo I heard that if you are playing on multiple devices like quest and pc simultaneously on the same account you could get banned\n\nI just want to know is this an issue with how vrchat is set up or is there something else going on that would cause this I don’t understand why you would ban someone for doing that",
